       "text": "Our game now supports the ASUS Aura Ready lighting module, providing an extraordinary experience for The Legend of Tian Ding. In addition to the traditional lighting module, Aura RGB boasts complex lighting combinations over simple glows or glints. May the inspiring feature light your journey with Tian Ding!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
